abstract: >-
  Research code for auditing the iRAP ViDA modelled
  fatal-and-serious-injury (FSI) risk surface using a two-stage
  workflow combining surrogate modelling with orthogonalized
  heterogeneity analysis and association-based candidate road-safety
  upgrade generation.

keywords:
  - road safety
  - iRAP
  - ViDA
  - fatal and serious injury
  - machine learning
  - surrogate modelling
  - double machine learning
  - causal forest
  - hotspot detection
  - SHAP

